{
    "talkId": "7665037",
    "total_dialogue_lines": 42,
    "speaker_counts": {
        "Ehrnrooth": 28,
        "Player": 14
    },
    "dialogues": [
        {
            "id": "766503701",
            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
            "text": "Hmm, where should this book go..."
        },
        {
            "id": "766503702",
            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
            "text": "#Oh, {NICKNAME}? Welcome! Lady Lauma mentioned you."
        },
        {
            "id": "766503703",
            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
            "text": "That said, if you're looking for her, you'll have to wait a bit — she just went out to attend to some business."
        },
        {
            "id": "766503704",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "Are you organizing the books?"
        },
        {
            "id": "766503705",
            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
            "text": "That I am. Since this library was built, Lady Lauma has asked us to shift as much of our book collection in as possible."
        },
        {
            "id": "766503706",
            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
            "text": "And then... She also requested that we make some cushions and stands for the animals..."
        },
        {
            "id": "766503707",
            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
            "text": "She said that this would give them a place to rest when they visit."
        },
        {
            "id": "766503708",
            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
            "text": "I don't really understand it, but she must have her reasons for giving such instructions."
        },
        {
            "id": "766503709",
            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
            "text": "Alright. We'll just put this book — and boy, is it thick as a brick — on the bottom-most shelf. That way, anyone who wants to use it as a footrest or stool just needs to pull it out.",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "766503710",
                    "text": "What does it record?",
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "id": "766503712",
                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                            "text": "Oh, don't worry, this is a running account of the words and deeds Moonchanters over various generations. It's in manuscript form, too..."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "766503713",
                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                            "text": "*sigh* And yes, I know that I shouldn't be saying this as a priestess, but this book is... likely the least interesting in this entire library."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "766503714",
                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                            "text": "It's just... \"on such and such a day, month, and year, Moonchanter A said this and did that, and these were the results or consequences\" all the way down."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "766503715",
                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                            "text": "I would flip through its pages every time sleep eluded me, and it worked like a charm every time.",
                            "choices": [
                                {
                                    "id": "766503716",
                                    "text": "Is there nothing interesting in it at all?",
                                    "response": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "766503718",
                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                            "text": "...Well, they exist, just not in that book. I have heard quite a good many such tales, though. I don't have this job for nothing, you know. Hehe.",
                                            "choices": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766503719",
                                                    "text": "Err, is that really a priestess's job?",
                                                    "response": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "766503721",
                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                            "text": "From my sister priestesses, of course! They know all sorts of stories, let me tell you."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "766503722",
                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                            "text": "For example, one of our previous Moonchanters had a strange habit of spending two hours soaking in a nearby lake whenever she had to organize some ceremony, regardless of the season."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "766503723",
                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                            "text": "She would say that the lake reflected the moon, and that she could enjoy the favor of its light and goddess while thusly immersed, which would then help the ceremony proceed smoothly."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "766503724",
                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                            "text": "In times where a great many ceremonies were held, she would be soaking practically every day...",
                                                            "choices": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "766503725",
                                                                    "text": "Those ceremonies went off without a wrinkle, then...",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "766503726",
                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                            "text": "Oh, absolutely, and she was a most capable Moonchanter. But..."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "766503729",
                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                            "text": "The long-term exposure to cold caused that devout Moonchanter to develop a serious case of arthritis, which forced her to bow out early..."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "766503730",
                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                            "text": "But despite that premature retirement, she maintained that the pain was a mark of the Moon Goddess's regard...",
                                                                            "choices": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766503731",
                                                                                    "text": "I don't think the Moon Goddess's dominions cover arthritis...",
                                                                                    "response": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "766503733",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                                            "text": "Well... The moon would be covered by the clouds and disappear when it would rain. She believed that the accompanying joint pains were the Moon Goddess bidding her farewell."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "766503734",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                                                                            "text": "And if the moon could be seen even in such times?"
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "766503735",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                                            "text": "Then it was the Moon Goddess's summons. She would run out into the rain, fully clothed, and begin to pray..."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "766503736",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                                            "text": "Later, in her old age, we had to find her an acolyte to watch her permanently and ensure that she did not risk her health further."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "766503737",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                                            "text": "And that lucky prie— Whoops, no, that fortunate acolyte... That was me.",
                                                                                            "choices": [
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "766503738",
                                                                                                    "text": "No wonder you know all these stories.",
                                                                                                    "response": [
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "766503740",
                                                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                                                            "text": "Hehe, of course. I wasn't just listening to her stories, though. I learned much as well."
                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "766503741",
                                                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                                                            "text": "If I get the chance in future, I'll write them all down in a book. Then I'll call it..."
                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "766503742",
                                                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                                                            "text": "Oh! Oh dear, oh dear, too much chatting, not enough book-sorting. Still... Hmm. What should I call that book..."
                                                                                                        }
                                                                                                    ]
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "766503739",
                                                                                                    "text": "It seems your time as an acolyte paid off, then."
                                                                                                }
                                                                                            ]
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766503732",
                                                                                    "text": "How are these two related, precisely?"
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "766503727",
                                                                    "text": "Could her body really hold up under all that?",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "766503728",
                                                                            "speaker": "Ehrnrooth",
                                                                            "text": "Haha... The ceremonies she organized went well, at least. But..."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766503720",
                                                    "text": "And where did you hear these tales, I wonder..."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766503717",
                                    "text": "I'd have thought there'd be some interesting anecdotes in there..."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "766503711",
                    "text": "That seems a bit... casual?"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}